{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Weyl群(一般子群)"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Weyl 群 (一般子群)"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":" $G$ 的子群 $H\\subset G$, 定义其 <strong>Weyl 群</strong> $W_GH := N(H)/H$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"正规化子","text":"正规化子"}},{"Plain":"的商.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>Weyl 子群是能够典范地作用于一个 $G$-作用的 $H$-"},{"Local":{"url":"不动点","text":"不动点"}},{"Plain":"的最大群.</p>\n<p>Weyl 群也是陪集空间 $G/H$ 在 $G$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"轨道范畴","text":"轨道范畴"}},{"Plain":"中的自同构群.</p>\n"}]}}